    "updated_at": "2026-06-19T03:05:57Z",
    "body": "I've added a bounds debug view to understand what's going on performance-wise:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"500\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/27016793-6e1d-4dec-ad54-852f26ebeef3\" />\r\n\r\nSome timing for the model:\r\n\r\n| | timing |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| original | ~10fps |\r\n| white standard mat | ~60fps |\r\n| merged white mat | 120fps |\r\n\r\nSo it looks like the large TLAS overlaps may be the fundamental issue 🤔",
